        "The sum of the first \\(k\\) odd numbers is \\(k^2\\)",
        "Each term simplifies to \\(\\sqrt{1},\\) \\(\\sqrt{4},\\) \\(\\sqrt{9},\\) and \\(\\sqrt{16}\\)"
      ],
